{"title":"List of mathematics competitions","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This list is intended to be global.  If other international or contests from other nations or regions are documented elsewhere, they should be added here as well.\n</p><p>This is a directory of internal links to more helpful pages about mathematics competitions.  This is not the place to list individual competitions.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#International_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">International mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Regional_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Regional mathematics competitions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#National_mathematics_competitions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">National mathematics competitions</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Argentina\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Argentina</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Australia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Australia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Austria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Austria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Bangladesh\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bangladesh</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Belgium\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Belgium</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Brazil\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Brazil</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Bulgaria\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Bulgaria</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Canada\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Canada</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#China\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">China</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Cyprus\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Cyprus</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Denmark\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Denmark</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#Germany\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Germany</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-16\"><a href=\"#Hungary\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Hungary</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-17\"><a href=\"#Greece\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Greece</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-18\"><a href=\"#India\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">India</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-19\"><a href=\"#Indonesia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.16</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Indonesia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-20\"><a href=\"#Ireland\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.17</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Ireland</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-21\"><a href=\"#Israel\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.18</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Israel</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-22\"><a href=\"#Mexico\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.19</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Mexico</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-23\"><a href=\"#Netherlands\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.20</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Netherlands</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-24\"><a href=\"#Norway\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.21</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Norway</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-25\"><a href=\"#Pakistan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.22</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Pakistan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-26\"><a href=\"#Peru\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.23</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Peru</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-27\"><a href=\"#Philippines\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.24</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Philippines</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-28\"><a href=\"#Poland\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.25</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Poland</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-29\"><a href=\"#Portugal\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.26</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Portugal</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-30\"><a href=\"#Romania\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.27</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Romania</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-31\"><a href=\"#Singapore\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.28</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Singapore</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-32\"><a href=\"#South_Korea\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.29</span> <span class=\"toctext\">South Korea</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-33\"><a href=\"#Slovakia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.30</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Slovakia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-34\"><a href=\"#South_Africa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.31</span> <span class=\"toctext\">South Africa</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-35\"><a href=\"#Spain\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.32</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Spain</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-36\"><a href=\"#Sweden\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.33</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sweden</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-37\"><a href=\"#Thailand\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.34</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Thailand</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-38\"><a href=\"#United_Kingdom\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.35</span> <span class=\"toctext\">United Kingdom</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-39\"><a href=\"#United_States\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.36</span> <span class=\"toctext\">United States</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-40\"><a href=\"#Uruguay\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.37</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Uruguay</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-41\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"International_mathematics_competitions\">International mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: International mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_international_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of international mathematics competitions\">List of international mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Regional_mathematics_competitions\">Regional mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Regional mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_regional_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of regional mathematics competitions\">List of regional mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"National_mathematics_competitions\">National mathematics competitions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: National mathematics competitions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Argentina\">Argentina</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Argentina\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Argentina_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Argentina mathematics competitions\">Argentina mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Australia\">Australia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Australia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Australia_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Australia mathematics competitions\">Australia mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Austria\">Austria</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Austria\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Austria_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Austria mathematics competitions (page does not exist)\">Austria mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bangladesh\">Bangladesh</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Bangladesh\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bangladesh_mathematics_competition\" title=\"Bangladesh mathematics competition\">Bangladesh mathematics competition</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Belgium\">Belgium</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Belgium\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Belgium_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Belgium mathematics competitions\">Belgium mathematics competitions</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brazil\">Brazil</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Brazil\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Brazilian mathematics competitions are categorized in two, one for public schools and other for particular schools.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Brazil_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Brazil mathematics competitions\">Brazil mathematics competitions</a></li></ul>\n<p>There's also some exams with the part of mathematics being as hard as an olympiad, but in the last years some of the questions in these exams are even harder than some olympiads. They're the military exams, such as <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Military_Institute_of_Engineering\" title=\"Military Institute of Engineering\">Military Institute of Engineering</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Military_Institute_of_Engineering\" title=\"Military Institute of Engineering\">IME</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Military_Institute_of_Engineering\" title=\"Military Institute of Engineering\">Instituto Militar de Engenharia</a>) and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technological_Institute_of_Aeronautics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Technological Institute of Aeronautics (page does not exist)\">Technological Institute of Aeronautics</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technological_Institute_of_Aeronautics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Technological Institute of Aeronautics (page does not exist)\">ITA</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Technological_Institute_of_Aeronautics&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Technological Institute of Aeronautics (page does not exist)\">Instituto Tecnológico de Aeronáutica</a>).\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bulgaria\">Bulgaria</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: Bulgaria\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Bulgaria_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Bulgaria mathematics competitions (page does not exist)\">Bulgaria mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Canada\">Canada</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=11\" title=\"Edit section: Canada\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_Canada_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of Canada mathematics competitions\">List of Canada mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"China\">China</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=12\" title=\"Edit section: China\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_China_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of China mathematics competitions\">List of China mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Cyprus\">Cyprus</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13\" title=\"Edit section: Cyprus\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Cyprus_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Cyprus mathematics competitions\">Cyprus mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Denmark\">Denmark</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14\" title=\"Edit section: Denmark\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Denmark_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Denmark mathematics competitions (page does not exist)\">Denmark mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Germany\">Germany</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15\" title=\"Edit section: Germany\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_Germany_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"List of Germany mathematics competitions (page does not exist)\">List of Germany mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Hungary\">Hungary</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16\" title=\"Edit section: Hungary\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Hungary_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Hungary mathematics competitions\">Hungary mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Greece\">Greece</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=17\" title=\"Edit section: Greece\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Greece_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Greece mathematics competitions (page does not exist)\">Greece mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"India\">India</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=18\" title=\"Edit section: India\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=India_mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"India mathematics competitions\">India mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Indonesia\">Indonesia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=19\" title=\"Edit section: Indonesia\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Indonesia_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Indonesia mathematics competitions\">Indonesia mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Ireland\">Ireland</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=20\" title=\"Edit section: Ireland\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Ireland_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"Ireland mathematics competitions\">Ireland mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Israel\">Israel</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=21\" title=\"Edit section: Israel\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Israeli_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Israeli mathematics competitions (page does not exist)\">Israeli mathematics competitions</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Mexico\">Mexico</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions&amp;action=edit&amp;section=22\" title=\"Edit section: Mexico\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mexico_ma